*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FEE0023
*> PURPOSE : FEE EXEMPTIONS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 256
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FEENIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0023.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY FEE0023C REPLACING ==:PFX:== BY ==TX==.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 WS-XFEE            PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM 3000-COUNT-FEE
    PERFORM 3100-BUS-SURCHG
    DISPLAY "WS-XFEE=" WS-XFEE
    STOP RUN.
3000-COUNT-FEE.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF TX-M-TX > 8
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF TX-M-TX > 10
        COMPUTE WS-XFEE = (TX-M-TX - 10) * 0.50
    END-IF.
3100-BUS-SURCHG.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF AT-BUSINESS
       AND TX-M-TX > 40
        ADD 15 TO WS-XFEE
    END-IF.
